A||||35||firstfiero||Came face to face with ROAD RAGE!||||1||
Z||000000||firstfiero||08-28-2001||10:22 PM||||     Pulling out from work for me is pretty hard. My store is along a busy road. Today I waited for 5 mins trying to pull out...finnaly a space opens up. I pull out fast and screech my tires...now the person coming down the same lane as I want in is probobly about 8 to 9 car lengths away. I had to pull out that fast because of the car going in opposite the direction that I wanted to go. Well I'm driving home and decide to head to a friends house....he manages a T.G.I.F and wanted to swap gift certificates. Anyway I'm on a one way street and come to a stop at a light in the lane to make a left when a car comes to a screeching stop next to me and a women is screaming at me "IF YOU EVER DO THAT A F!!!ING AGAIN I'LL F!!!ING SHOOT YOU". At first I'm stunned so I say "What the hell are you talking about" Again I wasn't anywhere near her when she pulled out. She says "UP IN DOVER YOU PULLED OUT IN FRONT OF ME...ILL F!!!ING KILL YOU NEXT TIME" So I say "whatever Tubby....blow" okay so maybe I shouldn't have called her tubby. Anyway I make a left turn on red...legally..I'm now on a two lane one way street. Well she lights up the tires on her p.o.s subaru and comes flying after me causing another car to come to a screeching stop. Anyway I come to a stop at the next light about a block from my friends house and she comes screeching up beside me and says "SO WHERE YOU GOING TO RUN TO NOW" I calmly say "Nowhere tubby...I just have better things to do then listen to Your fat A!! tell me how to drive." then she says again "I SWEAR TO GOD NEXT TIME I SEE YOU I'M GOING TO KILL YOU" so i say "And next time i see you i'm going to run you off the f!!!ing road!" So then she gets all wide eyed and says "Thats it I'm going to call the cops and  have you arrested for slander!" I really started laughing and asked her "Do you know what slander means?" " of course I do!!" at that I laughed and said "alright tubbo you go home and look that big word up...later." At that the light turned green and and I pulled away she followed righting something down...probobly my plates....and then went flying by me when I pulled over at my friends house. The funny thing is most times I intentonaly pull out hard and fast to fish tail out of their...okay so I'm showing off to my friends...but honestly this time I didn't fish tail at all. I even called back to the store after the incident to ask my friend at work...he was just coming back from a delivery and saw it. He agreed with me that she wasn't any where near me and that I didn't pull out half as wild as I usually do!! anyway sorry so long but I had to pass this story on!<P>------------------<BR><BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/firstfiero.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||Galen||08-28-2001||10:28 PM||||women||||reg||1
Z||000002||Cheever3000||08-28-2001||10:32 PM||||Wow, you have a lot of composure in a time like that.  Hard to say how I would have handled it.  Maybe now's a good time to decide, before it happens to me.<BR>||||reg||4
Z||000003||Brandon86SE||08-28-2001||10:37 PM||||Isn't that funny how someone will drive like a madman to chase you down to tell you how badly you drive?  I know I get people honking at me and stuff when I pull out in front of 'em.  The thing is that I've been driving my car for a couple years, and KNOW what I can get away with, if it's busy and I end up pulling out in front of someone, SO BE IT!  Just because I'm young and in a sports car, doesn't mean I don't know how to drive.  I sometimes get the impression that some people think that, and it annoys me.  I've been driving for 3 years now, without a ticket, or accident, or anything, a heck of a lot safer than a lot of people who road rage around here.<BR>Speaking of road rage, just last week a guy got shot up here.  Hit his collarbone, deflected off and went through his neck, and hit the other collarbone!  He survived, but that's scary stuff!<BR>Well, that's enough venting for today, back to studying for mid-terms....  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000004||Slammed Fiero||08-28-2001||10:48 PM||||Funny.. i just had an experience with road rage..no Fiero involved though.<P>I was moving back from college, the caprice wagon loaded to the roof , back seat down the whole deal. The caprice as some of you know is impala-zed , with grill , lowering springs , cop shocks , swaybars ,ROH 17" wheels , 255/50/17 BFG ZR's all around ,full dual exhaust , LT4 ..yes 4 ...small blcok , <P>The whole 9... Yes my dad has problems ...we don't own one car that isn't lowered...<P>In anycase , some kid was beside me in traffic in a New Turbo Beetle , thought he was hot sh** ... backwards hat , skanky lookin girlfriend ... 18 or so years old.. HE tried to race.<P>He Lost hard, I passed the kid going up hill at about 90 mph , left him like a parked car. Next light , he rolls down the window , asks me if I think i'm fast...I reply<P>Faster than you.. He spins the wheels.. I just laugh at him and wave with a smirk  on my face<P>The kid follows me to my Girlfriends work and says he gonna kick my ass and blah blah blah. I aksed how old he was ..he says 18 .I said ..You can tell.<P>He goes on about how it's american and it's automatic ..so it's junk.. I said ..well I still beat you will a full load of stuff in the back.<P>The kid is enraged now , has his FUBu stuff all in a knot. I said he's just mad because he got beat by a woodgrain wagon and he thought he was fast...<P>Again with the threats..<P>I walked away..<P>I'm going back up on the 6th (banditBalz's wedding on the 8th) with the Fiero , with NOS , (like I will need it)<P>Hope I see skippy...<P><BR><P>------------------<BR>Jonathan McCreery<BR>86 GT 4spd<BR>Koni's , Coilovers, Big Bars , 17" Trmotorsports Typhoons , 11.25" vented discs, Wilwood 4 Piston Calipers , Pirelli P Zero's, Short Shift, No cat , Cold air induction , Geni Stainless tips, White face gauges , Momo shift , momo pedals, White face Gauges , 70Hp Shot of NOS Autocrossed , Tracked , Dragged? (soon) abused.||||reg||1
Z||000005||MikeSchaefer||08-28-2001||10:50 PM||||At first she wanted to kill you, now she wants to kiss you.... Blow<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>I don't know if you were quoting Evil Dead 2 or not, but I thought I would throw that out.  Either way, I love the use of words.<BR>Mike Schaefer <A HREF="http://surf.to/fiero" TARGET=_blank>http://surf.to/fiero</A> ||||reg||14
Z||000006||Cozmo||08-28-2001||10:51 PM||||Whenever anything weird like that happens to me when I'm in my Fiero, I just remind myself that my other main driver is a...<BR>$200 '78 Oldsmobile!<BR>(evil laugh, can you say "bumper cars"?)<P><BR>BobC||||reg||10
Z||000007||artherd||08-28-2001||10:54 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Slammed Fiero:<BR><B> ... 18 or so years old.. <BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>...Old enough to go to jail for thretening...  so is that 'slander' lady.<P>Wow.  Hope I never run into anyone THAT insane.  I know immediately what I would do, be on the phone calling the cops.<P>That's crazy, and it's not "road rage" or somehow automatically OK once you're in a car... it's called *criminal activity* to threaten another person's life.  Peroid.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">  <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
Z||000008||firstfiero||08-28-2001||11:07 PM||||       I can tell you guys if i accendently pull out in front of you I will wave and apolagise. I mean I am human and have acidently cut people off. Normally if I have a problem after i say I'm sorry i usually say "So in all the time you've been driveing you've never made a mistake?" They usually look at me funny...because they realise that they've done it 1000 times....and drive off. I hope she called the cops I'm sure they would have laughed at her stupid ass and told her theirs nothing they can do. I probobly didn't help the situation by calling her tubby so many times and laughing at the same time.<P>------------------<BR><BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/firstfiero.gif"> ||||reg||14
Z||000009||Galen||08-28-2001||11:12 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by MikeSchaefer:<BR><B>At first she wanted to kill you, now she wants to kiss you.... Blow<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>I don't know if you were quoting Evil Dead 2 or not, but I thought I would throw that out.  Either way, I love the use of words.<BR>Mike Schaefer <A HREF="http://surf.to/fiero" TARGET=_blank>http://surf.to/fiero</A> </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Mike, that would actually be Evil Dead 3.. or Army of Darkness that you were quoting there.. "First ya wanna kill me, now ya wanna kiss me .. blow"  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Right before the evil bit.. I mean witch with the kettle goes freaky  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR><P>------------------<BR>Ray -      <A HREF="mailto:galen@ezrpg.com">galen@ezrpg.com</A>      - <A HREF="http://www.fierolinks.f2s.com/" TARGET=_blank>www.FieroLinks.f2s.com</A> - AIM: GalenRPG - ICQ: 98668558||||reg||1
