Z||000011||fierospeeder||08-29-2001||01:09 AM||||THIS IS ONE EPISODE OF ROAD RAGE when a GUN WOULD BE OKAY.<P><BR>You should have called the cops first, get her plate, and say she threatened to kill you.    Calling her a Fat Ass might get you arrested for sexual harassment because thats her handicap.<P>I guess you committed road rage, because you took her 9 car lengths of space and thats just plain wrong.<P>I own a 74 beetle and a 68 body, gonna restore when i get money or win the 200 million dollar powerball.   But the new beetles suck in some ways.  They are no way like the originals.   Its like getting a 2001 fiero with the engine in the front and it has 4 seats in it.   The new beetles are just a tad faster then the old beetles, 1/4 mile 30 seconds.  Cant wait to get a 190hp engine in mine.  New beetles are for yuppies that love cellular phones.||||reg||1
Z||000012||wkayl||08-29-2001||01:25 AM||||Don't wave to any one as if to say your sorry when you did a stupid thing.  I did that and the doodie head made a U-turn, ran me down and gaave me crap about flipping him off.  What really makes them mad is if you don't say a word and just smile.<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig_2.jpg"> <BR>Dnyee's 88 Formula, Casey's 86GT, Wayne's 86GT.  <BR>We consider my wife as being "Fiero Challenged"||||reg||1
Z||000013||Mach10||08-29-2001||01:26 AM||||I'm on the Sunday-run. My friend's driving, and this nasty riced out civic comes farting down the street, zippin' lanes, and generally making a nuisance of himself. Pulls up next to us. I'm busting a gut, and he asks me if I find something funny? I reply that I sure do, and offered his car some Maalox, 'cos it definitely has a gas problem. He yells "What?!?" but at that moment, some clowns across the street light'em up, and the light changes, so I just laughed, and waved him off. 3 minutes later, he pulls up to the other side, and starts threatening my friend. He's not a small guy, and in no-way intimidated by 2 skinny punks in a shite car. Apparantly the bald one asks my friend what I had said. I couldn't hear this, I'm just grinning like an ******* . He repeats my joke, and tells 'em that it's a joke, and not to get all defensive. The punk puts on his best Al Pacino face, and says "it better be, I'd hate to have to make a call." We both hear this and start laughing. My friend offers him his cell phone. These guys were getting hostile. So my friend says, "Ok, we're sorry, maybe your gay exhaust has something in front of it... What'ya got under the hood?" No response. "Wanna race? Think your exhaust will take this off the line?" Rice boy says that his honda would smoke it. We both laugh and tell him to watch for out tail-lights. Of course, it was no contest. I, of course, being the cautious one, had already loaded a fist with a roll of quarters, and was ready to hop out if one of them decided to get too personal. I hate punks like that, don't you?||||reg||1
